# ===========================================================================
#  .gitignore — NVMe-oF / RDMA (Windows NetworkDirect)
#
#  分三类：编译产物、跑测试留下的现场、以及**绝对不能提交的密钥**。
#  最后一类是重点：本工程的 -genkey 会生成 DH-HMAC-CHAP 密钥文件，
#  它一旦进了仓库就等于把认证凭据公开了。
# ===========================================================================

# ---- 编译产物 ----
*.exe
*.obj
*.pdb
*.lib
*.exp
*.ilk
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild
*.res
*.pgd
*.pgc
*.sbr
x64/
Debug/
Release/

# ---- Visual Studio ----
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.vsidx
DocumentLayout.json
Browse.VC.db
AutoPCH/

# ---- 跑测试/互操作留下的现场（都能重新生成） ----
*.log
*.err
f5_session_*.txt
f5_dirB_target*.txt
auth_srv*.txt
auth_cli*.txt
stag_srv*.txt
stag_cli*.txt
f7_*.txt
disc*.txt
x_srv.txt
x_cli.txt
admin_srv.txt
mq_srv.txt
ns_srv.txt
reset_srv.txt
manual_srv.txt
f1_*.txt
f3_*.txt
f4_*.txt
f5_srv.txt
f5_cli.txt
f6_*.txt
rfc7919.txt              # gen_dhgroups.ps1 会按需重新下载
interop_link_state.json  # 桥接前的网络状态记录，脚本自己会写
interop_link_state.json.bak-*

# ---- 密钥与凭据（务必不要提交） ----
*authkey*
*.key
*.pem
*_pubkey*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ---- 本地镜像/卷文件 ----
*.img
*.vhd
*.vhdx

# ---- 工具链 ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
# capture/debug artifacts from the iSCSI A/B runs (never deliverables)
proxy_dump.txt
ref_capture.txt
ref_capture*.txt
*.log
regression*.log

# Kernel drivers are build products: derived from src/driver/*.c by the commands in
# DRIVER-D0.md, and a committed binary would be a stale copy nobody rebuilds.
*.sys
